# Phoring — Caddy reverse proxy
# :80 catch-all keeps the raw IP (http://35.200.201.102) working.
# phoring.in + www auto-provision a Let's Encrypt TLS cert once DNS resolves.

:80 {
    encode gzip zstd
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:10000 {
        header_up X-Forwarded-Proto {scheme}
    }
}

phoring.in, www.phoring.in {
    encode gzip zstd
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:10000 {
        header_up X-Forwarded-Proto {scheme}
    }
}